Huh? Management right now... Huh, has my voice been audible this whole time? Can you hear it?

108
00:16:11,024 --> 00:16:15,024
あれ、あの…
Huh? Um...

109
00:16:18,024 --> 00:16:21,024
いや違う、あ、みんなごめん！
No wait, ah, everyone sorry!

110
00:16:36,024 --> 00:16:43,024
今本当は聞こえてないのが正しくて、あのロボ子が、あの、咳き込みたい時とか、
Actually, it's correct that you couldn't hear it, when Roboco wanted to cough or something,

111
00:16:43,024 --> 00:16:51,024
