but I wondered if it wasn't muted, which one was it? I panicked just now, so I asked.

113
00:17:00,024 --> 00:17:05,024
そう、咳払い音をね、ちょっとばれないように、あの、してたんだけど、あ、ばれちゃったな。
Yeah, I was doing that so the throat-clearing sound wouldn't be noticed, but ah, it got noticed.

114
