I'd be happy if you post lots of tweets and screenshots too. Peace!

119
00:17:31,024 --> 00:17:36,024
っていうわけで、それでは聴いてください。「ホームラ…」
That being said, well then, please listen. "Homu..."

120
00:18:00,344 --> 00:18:06,344
